      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Dolores Kaufman often begins her pieces by transmuting scanned photos and objects into new digital images. She seeks to explore the mystery and symbolism embedded in the seemingly mundane ephemera with which we share our lives. Kaufman's Eye Sea will be included in the MoonArk, a six-inch-tall capsule designed by a team at Carnegie Mellon University that will be travelling to the moon in competition for the Google Lunar X Prize."},
